
---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Medical & Health Disclaimer | Finavit Journal"
  description="Read the Finavit Journal health and nutrition disclaimer, including important information about educational content and professional medical advice."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">IMPORTANT INFORMATION</span>
    <h1>Health <em>Disclaimer.</em></h1>
    <p>Understanding the purpose and limitations of the information published on Finavit Journal.</p>
    <span class="updated">Last updated: November 16, 2026</span>
  </section>

  <article class="content">
    <div class="notice">
      <strong>Please read carefully:</strong>
      Finavit Journal provides educational information only. Our
      content is not a substitute for professional medical advice,
      diagnosis, or treatment.
    </div>

    <h2>1. Educational Purpose Only</h2>
    <p>
      The articles, guides, explanations, and other materials published
      on Finavit Journal are intended for general educational and
      informational purposes.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our content discusses topics such as nutrition, food, vitamins,
      dietary concepts, and general wellness. It is designed to help
      readers better understand these subjects, not to provide
      individualized medical care.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Not Medical Advice</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing on this website should be interpreted as medical advice,
      a diagnosis, a treatment recommendation, or a prescription.
      Reading our content does not establish a doctor-patient
      relationship or any other professional healthcare relationship.
    </p>
    <p>
      Always seek the advice of a qualified healthcare professional
      regarding medical conditions, symptoms, treatments, medications,
      supplements, or changes to your diet.
    </p>
    <p>
      Never disregard professional medical advice or delay seeking
      it because of something you have read on this website.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Nutrition and Dietary Information</h2>
    <p>
      Nutritional needs vary between individuals. Factors such as age,
      health status, lifestyle, medications, allergies, and personal
      circumstances can affect what is appropriate for a person.
    </p>
    <p>
      Information about nutrients, vitamins, foods, and dietary
      practices should not be treated as a personalized dietary plan.
      Consult a registered dietitian or another qualified healthcare
      professional for advice suited to your circumstances.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Vitamins and Supplements</h2>
    <p>
      Articles discussing vitamins, minerals, and supplements are
      intended to explain general information and available research.
      They do not recommend that every reader take a particular
      supplement or dosage.
    </p>
    <p>
      Supplements may interact with medications or cause unwanted
      effects. Consult a qualified healthcare professional before
      starting, stopping, or changing any supplement.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Accuracy and Scientific Information</h2>
    <p>
      We aim to publish clear, useful information informed by credible
      sources and scientific research. However, medical and nutritional
      knowledge evolves, and information may become outdated or
      incomplete.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not guarantee that every article will always be complete,
      current, or applicable to every reader.
    </p>

    <h2>6. AI-Generated Information</h2>
    <p>
      Some digital tools available through the wider Finavit platform
      use artificial intelligence to provide informational responses.
      AI-generated information can contain errors, omissions, or
      misleading statements.
    </p>
    <p>
      AI-generated responses should not be relied upon as a substitute
      for professional medical judgment. Always verify important
      health-related information with qualified professionals.
    </p>

    <h2>7. External Links</h2>
    <p>
      Our articles may reference or link to external websites,
      publications, and resources. These links are provided for
      additional information. We do not control or guarantee the
      accuracy, availability, or content of external websites.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Limitation of Responsibility</h2>
    <p>
      To the extent permitted by applicable law, Finavit Journal
      and its operators are not responsible for decisions, actions,
      or outcomes resulting from reliance on information published
      on this website.
    </p>
    <p>
      Nothing in this disclaimer excludes or limits any liability
      that cannot legally be excluded or limited.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this disclaimer, contact us:
    </p>
    <p class="contact">
      <strong>Email:</strong>
      <a href="mailto:privacy@finavit.com">privacy@finavit.com</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 85px 24px 65px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #f0f2e9;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: #68806d;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin: 22px 0 14px;
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 66px);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .hero h1 em {
    color: #52745a;
  }

  .hero p {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: auto;
    color: #68736a;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .updated {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 22px;
    color: #849087;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 790px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 65px 24px 85px;
  }

  .content h2 {
    margin: 42px 0 13px;
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .content p {
    color: #68736a;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .content a {
    color: #315e42;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .notice {
    padding: 23px;
    border-left: 3px solid #52745a;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #f0f2e9;
    color: #526157;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .contact {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e8df;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fdfdf9;
  }
</style>
